    "text": "Figure 8 — Comparison grid for three wireframe prompts (rows: \"login page\", \"search page on a job searching app\", \"display food recipes\") across six columns: \"LayoutTransformer\" (coloured-block layouts with a legend for Button, Icon, Image, Input, Text, Toolbar), \"DALLE\", \"Stable Diffusion\" and \"MidJourney\" (colour phone mockups whose text is garbled and illegible), and \"WireGen\" (grey wireframes: a Welcome login screen with email/password and Google/Facebook buttons, a JOB SEARCHING screen with search fields and SEARCH button, and a FOODS recipe screen with image tiles and a bottom tab bar).",
